<title>FINLAND: Finnair 1996/97 profit falls 42 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnair 1996/97 profit falls 42 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to end-March,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     310 vs 533</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   2.48 vs 4.56</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    1.00 vs 1.00</p>
<p> Net sales					  7,403 vs 7,186</p>
<p> Operating profit				   326 vs 624</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of 11 analysts' forecasts for Finnish national carrier Finnair's full-year profit before extras, tax had been 354 million markka in a 230-415 million range.  </p>
<p> Net financial items			charge 16 vs 91 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 gain 119 vs nil</p>
<p> Net profit					   323 vs 372</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    41.7 vs 37.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Finnair Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
